Task 3: Simulate Node Failure and Verify VM Failover
Subtask 3.1: Prepare for Failover Testing
Before simulating failures, let's set up monitoring and create additional VMs for testing:

# Create a monitoring script to watch VM status
cat > monitor-vms.sh << 'EOF'
#!/bin/bash
echo "Monitoring VM status - Press Ctrl+C to stop"
while true; do
    clear
    echo "=== VM Status at $(date) ==="
    oc get vmi -o wide
    echo ""
    echo "=== Node Status ==="
    oc get nodes
    sleep 5
done
EOF

